WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.613
Day 3. Counting to Ten With a Ten Frame.

2
00:00:03.063 --> 00:00:11.063
Watch first. Show it with real things. The first one on the page is done for you. Then do one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:11.563 --> 00:00:16.909
First, cut out the number cards. They are on the page after day two, with a big ten frame.

4
00:00:17.359 --> 00:00:21.951
A ten frame is two rows of five. Fill the top row first, from the left.

5
00:00:22.401 --> 00:00:27.678
Put seven things on the frame. Say: a full row is five. Five, and two more. Seven.

6
00:00:28.278 --> 00:00:32.269
Count them together to check. Then put the seven card beside the frame.

7
00:00:32.869 --> 00:00:37.645
Soon your child sees seven without counting each one. That is the point of the frame.

8
00:00:38.345 --> 00:00:43.507
Job one: five frames. Your child writes how many in each. A full row is five.

9
00:00:43.957 --> 00:00:47.000
Job two: draw a line from each frame to its number.
